  "about_brand_heading": "About the brand",
  "about_brand_name": "The name comes from realign. That's what we want you to do: reorganize your finances, regain clarity and adjust what needs to change, without having to be a finance expert.",
  "about_brand_origin": "Rialign started with a question: what if looking after your money were simple, pleasant and left you feeling in control? Instead of screens crowded with numbers and charts, a clean, calm experience made for everyday use.",
  "about_brand_symbol": "In the symbol, four independent pieces fit together to form an R. Just like your accounts, cards and spending: separate parts that, once aligned, make up one organized financial life. The space between them keeps everything light and easy to read, just like the app.",
